  "name": "Butternut Squash Lasagne",
  "subtitle": "Roasted squash, spinach, and creamy cheese sauce layered with pasta",
  "description": "A comforting vegetable lasagne combining roasted butternut squash, wilted spinach, sage, and a creamy mascarpone sauce.",
